ning step for healthy (008a/008c) vs collapsed\n    (006/008d) configurations. If collapsed configs show entropy increase → actor\n    confusion from delusional critic gradients.\n  priority: P1\n  gpu_budget_hours: 0\n  deps: []\n- id: plan_032\n  name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n  claim:\n  - C2\n  - C3\n  description: Distribution plots of V(s) vs Monte Carlo return for trained vs untrained\n    dt_emb. More informative than single v/e ratio — directly shows where value estimates\n    diverge.\n  priority: P2\n  gpu_budget_hours: 1\n  deps: []\n- id: plan_033\n  name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n  claim:\n  - C2\n  description: 'Analyze learned dt_embedding vectors: cosine similarity between dt=1\n    and dt=2 embeddings, and how this evolves during training.'\n  priority: P2\n  gpu_budget_hours: 0\n  deps: []\n- id: plan_050\n  name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n  claim:\n  - C1\n  - C2\n  - C3\n  description: dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment, broadening scope beyond\n    locomotion tasks\n  priority: P0\n  gpu_budget_hours: 15\n  deps: []\n- id: plan_051\n  name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  claim:\n  - C1\n  - C2\n  description: Replicate delusional critic collapse in Cartpole Swingup\n  priority: P0\n  gpu_budget_hours: 15\n  deps:\n  - plan_050\n- id: plan_052\n  name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  claim:\n  - C2\n  description: Replicate causal control (no dt_embedding → no collapse) in Cartpole\n    Swingup\n  priority: P0\n  gpu_budget_hours: 15\n  deps:\n  - plan_050\n- id: plan_024\n  name: CANCELLED — Cheetah Run dt=1 imagination mitigation\n  claim:\n  - C6\n  description: 'CANCELLED after D038: C6 mitigation falsified in Walker Walk (1/2\n    collapse). Cross-environment C6 validation no longer meaningful.'\n  priority: CANCELLED\n  gpu_budget_hours: 0\n  deps:\n  - plan_020\n- id: plan_053\n  name: CANCELLED — Cartpole Swingup dt=