{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LC7maEr5DysaDQ25t27NtA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have the full picture. Let me construct the comprehensive best-tier predictions for all 20 planned experiments (excluding 3 CANCELLED ones = 17 planned).\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Forward-pass intervention thesis cross-seed + cross-env validated — 诊断论文升级为 diagnosis + principled mitigation。\n  核心叙事：backward-pass 干预全面失败（C7, 17 seeds, 3 SGS 变体, 2 environments）→ forward-pass noise injection 成功（C8, TCN）\n  → 确证 CIVO 是 forward-pass representational damage 而非 gradient contamination。\n  TCN σ=0.2 在 Walker 跨 seed 复现（2/2 seeds NVE < 1.0×），TCN σ=0.5 在 Cheetah 成功（NVE 从 8-108× 降至 1.5-4×）。\n  Dose-response（σ 与 untreated CIVO severity 正相关）提供额外机制洞察。\n  标题更新为 \"Diagnosing and Mitigating Value Overestimation from Temporal Abstraction in DreamerV3\"。\n  C1-C8 全文保留，8 claims 全部有充分数据支撑。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Walker Walk — 多 seed 扩展（C2/C3/C6 验证）\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_011\n    description: >\n      复制 008d（subsample ON + trained dt_emb + H=8）崩溃模式。\n      seed 1 = exp_009e（已完成），seed 2 = exp_009b（已完成）。\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_009e_008d_walker_s1\n      seed1_eval_return_105K: 131.08\n      seed1_nve_peak: 4.12\n      seed1_nve_peak_step: 55000\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed1_collapse_type: \"classic CIVO — value-driven, entropy ↓\"\n      seed1_value_mean_105K: 135.37\n      seed2_exp_id: exp_009b_008d_walker_s2\n      seed2_eval_return_105K: 267.93\n      seed2_nve_peak: 2.05\n      seed2_nve_peak_step: 25000\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed2_self_correction: true\n      seed2_value_mean_105K: 67.27\n      cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x: \"2/2 seeds\"\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"1/2 (stochastic)\"\n      nve_threshold_classification: \"2/2 correct (both > 1.5×)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      两个 seed 均产生 NVE>1.5× episode，确证 trained dt_emb 可靠触发病态 value overestimation。\n      Seed 1 NVE 在 35K-55K 连续 3 个 checkpoint 维持 >1.5×（1.71→2.09→4.12），锁定正反馈循环→崩溃。\n      Seed 2 NVE 在 45K 达 1.62× 但立即回落（55K=1.41→65K=0.94），value 自修正→无崩溃。\n      差异源于早期训练随机性（initialization + data sampling order）决定 \"point of no return\" 是否被触发。\n      机制一致：trained dt_emb 使 RSSM 和 critic 对精确 dt 信号过度 co-adaptation，\n      但 RSSM 在 dt>1 的 prediction 质量不足以支撑这种精度 → value 系统性高估。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008d 跨 seed NVE 对比\"\n        columns: [\"step\", \"seed1_nve\", \"seed1_eval\", \"seed2_nve\", \"seed2_eval\"]\n        rows:\n          - [25000, 1.78, 167.2, 2.05, 141.1]\n          - [35000, 1.71, 146.3, 1.24, 164.1]\n          - [45000, 2.09, 140.8, 1.62, 141.0]\n          - [55000, 4.12, 82.7, 1.41, 172.3]\n          - [65000, 1.23, 250.0, 0.94, 209.2]\n          - [105000, 1.57, 131.1, 0.38, 267.9]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双 seed NVE 时序曲线。Seed 1 NVE 持续上升→崩溃（红），Seed 2 NVE 瞬态脉冲→自修正（蓝）。1.5× 水平虚线标记病态阈值。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C2 诊断标记确立：NVE≥1.5× 在 trained dt_emb 下 2/2 seeds 出现（100%），\n      在 untrained/absent dt_emb 下 0/2 seeds 出现（0%）。4/4 完美分离。\n      崩溃本身是随机的（1/2），但诊断信号是确定的。\n      这是论文 C2 最强定量结果。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_012\n    description: >\n      复制 008f（subsample ON + dt_embed_dim=0 + H=8）因果控制。\n      seed 1 = exp_009f（原运行被 killed，需重跑），seed 2 = exp_009c（已完成）。\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_009f_008f_walker_s1_rerun\n      seed1_eval_return_105K: 380\n      seed1_nve_max_35Kplus: 0.85\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed1_value_self_correction: true\n      seed1_trend: \"zigzag 恢复，类似 008f s0 (503@105K)\"\n      seed2_exp_id: exp_009c_008f_walker_s2\n      seed2_eval_return_105K: 148.34\n      seed2_nve_max_35Kplus: 1.14\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed2_trend: \"peak 359@75K then declined — no CIVO but performance unstable\"\n      cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x: \"0/2 seeds\"\n      supplementary_seeds:\n        seed3_exp_id: exp_008f_s3_no_dt_embed_walker\n        seed3_eval_final: 363.8\n        seed3_nve_peak: \"< 1.5×\"\n        seed4_exp_id: exp_008f_s4\n        seed4_eval_105K: 306.5\n        seed4_nve_peak: 1.41\n      all_seeds_below_1_5x: \"4/4 (s0=0.97, s2=1.14, s3<1.5, s4=1.41)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      去掉 dt_embedding 后，critic 无法利用精确 dt 信号进行系统性 co-adaptation。\n      Reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 75×）说明 reward head 完全丧失 dt 区分能力（reward gap=1.01×），\n      但这恰好阻断了 CIVO 正反馈循环的入口——无精确 conditioning → 无 exploitation。\n      4 个 seed 全部 NVE < 1.5×，与 008d 的 100% 超标形成完美对照。\n      性能波动大（148-503 range）因 reward 预测退化，但均不崩溃。\n      Seed 1 重跑预测 ~380 eval，基于 008f 四个 seed 的 eval 分布：\n      s0=503, s2=148, s3=364, s4=307 → 中位数 ~335, IQR [270, 420]。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008f (no dt_emb) 全 seed 汇总\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_105K\", \"nve_max_35K+\", \"collapse\", \"civo\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0\", 503, 0.97, \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s1 (pred)\", 380, 0.85, \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s2\", 148, 1.14, \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s3\", 364, \"< 1.5\", \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s4\", 307, 1.41, \"No\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      因果控制完全闭合：dt_embed_dim=0 → 0/4+ seeds 超 NVE 1.5× 阈值。\n      008f 角色是因果控制（证明 \"无 dt_embedding → 无 CIVO\"），不是推荐方案。\n      性能退化（vs baseline -45% 至 -84%）不影响因果结论。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_014\n    description: >\n      008e_v3（trained dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=1 imagination + H=15）多 seed 验证。\n      seed 1（已完成：成功），seed 2（已完成：崩溃）。\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_008e_v3_walker_s1\n      seed1_eval_return_105K: 869.9\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.80\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed1_vs_baseline: \"-5.0%\"\n      seed2_exp_id: exp_008e_v3_walker_s2\n      seed2_eval_return_105K: 137.0\n      seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      seed2_collapse_type: \"non-CIVO policy instability (eval-driven, entropy ↑)\"\n      seed2_actor_entropy_85K_to_105K: \"-5.21 → -3.83 (策略变随机)\"\n      collapse_rate: \"1/2 independent seeds\"\n      mitigation_verdict: \"PARTIALLY FALSIFIED — dt=1 imag eliminates Pathway A but not Pathway B\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Seed 1 在 dt=1 imagination 下 NVE 全程 0.72-0.80×（远低于 1.5× 阈值），\n      eval 单调上升至 869.9（95% baseline）。dt=1 限制成功阻断经典 CIVO（Pathway A）。\n      Seed 2 的崩溃机制与经典 CIVO 定性不同：value 变化温和（339→384→340, ±13%）\n      但 eval 先跌（715→452→137, -81%），NVE 高值是 eval 分母崩溃的结果而非 value 爆炸的原因。\n      Actor entropy 从 -5.21 升至 -3.83（策略从确定变随机），与 008d 的 entropy 下降（策略变确定→exploitation）相反。\n      这是 Pathway B：trained dt_embedding 通过 training data 中 dt>1 transitions 的存在，\n      即使 imagination 不使用 dt>1，仍对 RSSM latent representation 施加 subtle distortion，\n      在某些 seed 的初始化条件下触发 policy instability。\n      009a baseline s2 在同一步数完全稳定（618→596→836），排除 seed 脆弱假说。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008e_v3 两种崩溃路径对比\"\n        columns: [\"feature\", \"seed1_healthy\", \"seed2_collapsed\", \"008d_s0_classic_CIVO\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"eval_105K\", 869.9, 137.0, 82.7]\n          - [\"nve_105K\", 0.80, 3.78, 4.12]\n          - [\"value_change_85K→105K\", \"+106.6 (+30%)\", \"+0.5 (+0.1%)\", \"+77.7 (+130%)\"]\n          - [\"eval_change_85K→105K\", \"+212.6 (+32%)\", \"-578.2 (-81%)\", \"-64.2 (-44%)\"]\n          - [\"nve_driver\", \"n/a\", \"eval 分母崩溃\", \"value 分子爆炸\"]\n          - [\"actor_entropy_trend\", \"stable (-5.2)\", \"↑ rising (-5.2→-3.8)\", \"↓ falling (-3.5→-4.9)\"]\n          - [\"pathway\", \"none\", \"B (policy instability)\", \"A (classic CIVO)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 008e_v3 seed 1 vs seed 2 双面板。上：eval curves（seed 1 上升，seed 2 崩溃）。下：actor_entropy（seed 1 稳定，seed 2 发散）。标注 Pathway A vs B 差异。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C6 核心发现：trained dt_embedding 通过至少两条路径创造脆弱性。\n      dt=1 imagination 消除 Pathway A（critic 在 imagination 中不使用 dt>1 → 无 CIVO 正反馈循环），\n      但不消除 Pathway B（training data 中 dt>1 transitions 影响 RSSM representation quality）。\n      论文措辞：\"Restricting imagination to dt=1 does not reliably prevent collapse\n      in the presence of trained dt-embedding.\"\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_013\n    description: >\n      008a（subsample OFF + trained dt_emb unexposed to dt>1 + H=15）跨 seed 复制。\n      实质等价于 untrained dt_emb（从未接触 dt>1 数据，embedding 学不到有意义的 dt 区分）。\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_008a_unexposed_s1\n      seed1_eval_return_105K: 630.91\n      seed1_ve_ratio_105K: 0.43\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.66\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed1_value_suppression: true\n      seed2_exp_id: exp_008a_unexposed_s2\n      seed2_eval_return_105K: 899.4\n      seed2_ve_ratio_105K: 0.333\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.51\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed2_value_suppression: true\n      seed0_reference:\n        eval_105K: 777.66\n        nve_105K: 0.59\n      cross_seed_nve_range: \"0.51-0.66 (all < 1.0×)\"\n      cross_seed_eval_range: \"631-899\"\n      vs_baseline_range: \"-2% to -31%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      subsample OFF 意味着 training data 中不含 dt>1 transitions，dt_embedding 虽有参数但从未被暴露于\n      需要区分 dt=1 vs dt=2 的信号。等价效果：embedding 保持近随机初始化状态，\n      不会形成精确 dt conditioning → critic 无法 exploit dt-specific prediction error。\n      NVE 全程 < 1.0× 确证 value growth 被结构性压制。\n      跨 seed eval 方差大（631-899）反映任务随机性，不影响 CIVO 诊断结论。\n      Seed 2 (899.4) 接近 baseline (916)，说明在好的初始化下 unexposed dt_emb 几乎无性能损失。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008a (unexposed) 全 seed 汇总\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_105K\", \"nve_105K\", \"vs_baseline\", \"collapse\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0\", 777.7, 0.59, \"-15.1%\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s1\", 630.9, 0.66, \"-31.1%\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s2\", 899.4, 0.51, \"-1.8%\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      C3 跨 seed 确认：3/3 seeds NVE < 1.0×，无 CIVO。\n      Value growth 压制是结构性的（NVE 随训练远离 1.0 而非趋近），\n      机制：未接触 dt>1 数据 → dt_embedding 无法学到有意义的 temporal 区分 → 阻断 co-adaptation。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\"\n    plan_id: plan_015\n    description: >\n      dt_embedding 参数 requires_grad=False，保持随机初始化不训练。\n      其余与 008d 完全一致。诊断：dt_emb 的 TRAINING 是否是 CIVO 必要条件？\n    expected_results:\n      exp_id: exp_015b_frozen_dt_emb\n      eval_return_105K: 204.2\n      nve_85K: 0.467\n      nve_95K: 0.394\n      nve_105K: 0.42\n      nve_max_35Kplus: 0.47\n      collapse: false\n      collapse_type: \"gradient starvation — distinct from CIVO\"\n      actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n      actor_entropy_105K: -4.855\n      gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n      failure_mode: \"NVE << 1.0 (critic under-estimates), actor_loss→0, eval volatile 80-238\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Frozen dt_emb 传入随机固定向量给 RSSM 和 heads，但不接收梯度更新。\n      结果是一种不同于 CIVO 的失败模式：\n      (1) NVE 0.39-0.47（远低于 1.0×）— critic 系统性低估 value（与 CIVO 的高估相反）；\n      (2) actor_loss → 0（梯度饥饿）— actor 无法从不校准的 critic 获得有意义学习信号；\n      (3) eval 在 80-238 间剧烈震荡，无稳定收敛。\n      这确认：dt_emb 的 TRAINING（而非 mere presence）是 CIVO 必要条件。\n      随机固定 embedding 不提供可 exploit 的精确 dt 信息 → 无 CIVO，\n      但也不提供有用时间信息 → 性能极差。\n      与 008d（trained, CIVO 崩溃）和 008f（absent, 无 CIVO 但 reward 退化）构成 2×2 矩阵第三象限。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"dt_embedding 状态 vs 失败模式 2×2 矩阵\"\n        columns: [\"dt_emb_state\", \"present_dt2_data\", \"absent_dt2_data\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trained\", \"008d: CIVO 崩溃 (NVE 2-4×)\", \"008a: value suppression (NVE 0.5-0.7×)\"]\n          - [\"Frozen (random)\", \"015b: gradient starvation (NVE 0.4×)\", \"n/a (no dt_emb to freeze)\"]\n          - [\"Absent (dim=0)\", \"008f: no CIVO, reward degraded (NVE 0.3-1.1×)\", \"= baseline\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      2×2 矩阵闭合。CIVO 只在 [Trained × Present dt>1 data] 象限出现。\n      Frozen dt_emb 创造第三种失败模式（梯度饥饿），支持\"dt_emb training 是 CIVO 必要条件\"的强论断。\n      论文中作为 C2 的补充机制证据。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\"\n    plan_id: plan_016\n    description: >\n      扩展 008e_v3 到 4 个 seed，收窄崩溃概率估计。\n    expected_results:\n      seed3_exp_id: exp_008e_v3_s3\n      seed3_eval_return_105K: 92.7\n      seed3_nve_peak: 4.02\n      seed3_collapse: true\n      seed3_collapse_onset: \"85K-95K\"\n      seed4_exp_id: exp_008e_v3_s4\n      seed4_eval_return_105K: 899.3\n      seed4_nve_peak: 0.99\n      seed4_collapse: false\n      four_seed_collapse_rate: \"2/4 (50%)\"\n      four_seed_healthy_eval_mean: 884.6\n      four_seed_collapsed_eval_mean: 114.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      4 个 seed 中 2 个崩溃（s2, s3）、2 个健康（s1, s4），崩溃率 50%。\n      与 008d（dt=2 imagination）的 ~50% 崩溃率一致，确认 dt=1 imagination 未降低崩溃概率。\n      崩溃的 seed 均表现出 Pathway B 特征（eval-driven 而非 value-driven），\n      健康的 seed NVE 全程 < 1.0×。\n      二项分布 95% CI for p=0.5 at n=4: [0.07, 0.93]，样本量不足以精确估计 p，\n      但 2/4 与 008d 的 ~1/2 一致性强化\"dt=1 imagination 不改善崩溃概率\"的结论。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008e_v3 (dt=1 imag) 全 4 seed 汇总\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_105K\", \"nve_peak\", \"collapse\", \"pathway\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s1\", 869.9, 0.80, \"No\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"s2\", 137.0, 3.78, \"Yes\", \"B (eval-driven)\"]\n          - [\"s3\", 92.7, 4.02, \"Yes\", \"B (eval-driven)\"]\n          - [\"s4\", 899.3, 0.99, \"No\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      C6 最终状态：dt=1 imagination 崩溃率 2/4 = 50%，与 dt=2 一致。\n      论文报告：dt=1 restriction 不是有效 mitigation，trained dt_emb 本身即脆弱性来源。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Cheetah Run — 跨环境验证\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_020\n    description: >\n      Cheetah Run dt=1 baseline，建立第二环境参考性能和 v/e 校准。\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_exp_id: exp_023a_cheetah_baseline_s0\n      seed0_eval_final: 624.7\n      seed0_eval_peak: 624.7\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_023b_cheetah_baseline_s1\n      seed1_eval_final: 520.3\n      seed1_eval_peak: 572.9\n      seed2_exp_id: exp_023_cheetah_baseline_s2\n      seed2_eval_final: 645.4\n      additional_seeds:\n        seed3_eval_final: 642.1\n        seed4_eval_final: 537.0\n      cross_seed_eval_mean: 593.9\n      cross_seed_eval_std: 56.8\n      ve_ratio_stable: \"0.50-0.70\"\n      convergence_step: \"~180K\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cheetah Run 是 DMC locomotion 标准环境，DreamerV3 在此任务上收敛到 ~520-650 range。\n      跨 seed 方差较大（std ~57），属于 Cheetah Run 的正常变异范围。\n      v/e ratio 稳定在 0.50-0.70，低于 Walker（0.69-0.72），因 Cheetah 的 reward scale 不同。\n      收敛速度略慢于 Walker（~180K vs ~120K），因 Cheetah 的动作空间和动力学更复杂。\n      5 个 seed 提供充分的 NVE 归一化基准。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Cheetah baseline 建立。均值 ~594, SD ~57。用于归一化 CIVO 实验的 NVE。\n      与 Walker baseline (~940) 的量级差异不影响 NVE 归一化后的 cross-env 可比性。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_021\n    description: >\n      Cheetah 环境的 CIVO 触发实验。预期 CIVO 严重程度远超 Walker（因 Cheetah RSSM fidelity gap 更大）。\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_exp_id: exp_010b_cheetah_civo_trigger_s0\n      seed0_eval_105K: 0.83\n      seed0_nve_105K: 70.64\n      seed0_civo_severity: \"catastrophic\"\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_010b_cheetah_civo_trigger\n      seed1_eval_final: 51.7\n      seed1_eval_peak: 321.9\n      seed1_nve_peak: 8.27\n      seed1_civo_severity: \"severe\"\n      seed2_predicted:\n        eval_peak: 280\n        eval_105K: 15\n        nve_peak: 45\n        civo_severity: \"catastrophic\"\n      cross_seed_nve_range: \"8.3-70.6× (vs Walker 2-4×)\"\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"3/3\"\n      civo_severity_vs_walker: \"10-35× more severe\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cheetah Run 的 CIVO 严重程度远超 Walker，原因：\n      (1) Cheetah 动力学更复杂（6-DOF vs Walker 的 2-DOF），RSSM 在 dt>1 的 prediction error 更大；\n      (2) reward landscape 更陡峭（速度奖励的梯度更大），微小 state error 对 reward 影响放大；\n      (3) 这两者叠加使 trained dt_emb 的 co-adaptation 更剧烈。\n      结果是 NVE 达到 8-70× 量级（Walker 仅 2-4×），所有 seed 均崩溃（无自修正）。\n      Seed 2 预测 NVE~45×，eval 降至 ~15（近随机策略），基于 s0 和 s1 的 severity 分布。\n      这为 TCN dose-response 假说提供关键对照：\n      Cheetah 需要 σ=0.5（而非 Walker 的 σ=0.2）才能匹配其更高的 CIVO severity。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cheetah CIVO severity vs Walker\"\n        columns: [\"environment\", \"nve_range\", \"collapse_rate\", \"typical_onset\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker Walk\", \"2-4×\", \"~50% (3/6 seeds)\", \"35-55K\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah Run\", \"8-70×\", \"100% (3/3 seeds)\", \"45-65K\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Walker vs Cheetah NVE 时序对比（log scale Y 轴）。Cheetah NVE 峰值比 Walker 高 1-2 个数量级。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cheetah 的更高 CIVO severity 支持 dose-response 论题：\n      untreated severity 越高 → 需要更大 σ（噪声剂量）来抑制。\n      Walker CIVO 轻（2-4×）→ σ=0.2 足够；Cheetah CIVO 重（8-70×）→ σ=0.2 不够（exp_030a 确认），需 σ=0.5。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_022\n    description: >\n      Cheetah 因果控制：去掉 dt_embedding 应消除 CIVO。\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_exp_id: exp_024b_cheetah_no_dt_emb_s0\n      seed0_eval_final: 96.5\n      seed0_nve_peak: 0.2\n      seed0_civo: false\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_024b_cheetah_no_dt_emb_s1\n      seed1_eval_final: 77.3\n      seed1_nve_peak: 0.1\n      seed1_civo: false\n      seed2_predicted:\n        eval_105K: 85\n        nve_peak: 0.15\n        civo: false\n      cross_seed_nve_max: 0.2\n      cross_seed_civo_rate: \"0/3\"\n      vs_baseline_pct: \"~14% of baseline\"\n      reward_mae_vs_baseline: \"~60-80×\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      与 Walker 008f 模式一致：去掉 dt_embedding 彻底阻断 CIVO（0/3 seeds NVE > 1.5×）。\n      性能极差（~14% baseline）因 reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2 transitions，\n      reward_MAE 预计为 baseline 的 60-80×（Cheetah reward range 更大 → 绝对误差更大）。\n      NVE 极低（0.1-0.2×）反映 critic 系统性低估。\n      Cheetah 的因果控制结论与 Walker 完全一致：\n      dt_embedding 是 CIVO 的必要条件，跨环境成立。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-env 因果控制确认。Walker + Cheetah 共 7+ seeds 的 no-dt_emb 实验，\n      全部 NVE < 1.5×。嵌入移除 → CIVO 消除是环境无关的。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_023\n    description: >\n      Cheetah 的 unexposed dt_emb（subsample OFF）实验，验证 C3 value suppression 跨环境成立。\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_exp_id: exp_008a_cheetah_unexposed_s0\n      seed0_eval_105K: 532.35\n      seed0_nve_105K: 0.49\n      seed0_value_suppression: true\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_008a_cheetah_unexposed_s1\n      seed1_eval_105K: 504.38\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.478\n      seed1_value_suppression: true\n      seed2_predicted:\n        eval_105K: 520\n        nve_105K: 0.50\n        value_suppression: true\n      cross_seed_nve_range: \"0.48-0.50\"\n      cross_seed_eval_mean: 519\n      vs_baseline_pct: \"~87% of Cheetah baseline\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Unexposed dt_emb（subsample OFF → 无 dt>1 training data）在 Cheetah 上同样产生 value suppression。\n      NVE 稳定在 ~0.48-0.50×（Cheetah baseline v/e 较低导致 NVE 比 Walker 的 0.51-0.66 更接近 0.5）。\n      Performance 保持在 baseline 的 ~87%，与 Walker 的 008a（85% baseline）高度一致。\n      这确认：value growth suppression 是环境无关的结构性效应，\n      不依赖于 Walker-specific 的 reward 或 dynamics 特征。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Unexposed dt_emb 跨环境一致性\"\n        columns: [\"environment\", \"eval_vs_baseline\", \"nve_range\", \"seeds_below_1x\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker Walk\", \"85% (778/916)\", \"0.51-0.66\", \"3/3\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah Run\", \"87% (519/594)\", \"0.48-0.50\", \"3/3\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      C3 跨环境确认。两个环境中 unexposed dt_emb 均产生:\n      (1) NVE < 1.0×（value growth suppression），(2) 保持 ~85-87% baseline 性能。\n      机制一致：无 dt>1 exposure → embedding 学不到有意义的 temporal 区分 → 阻断 co-adaptation。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 诊断分析（0 GPU）\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\"\n    plan_id: plan_030\n    description: >\n      量化 RSSM 在 dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions 上的预测质量差异。\n      已完成（exp_rssm_fidelity_analysis）。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_dt1_obs_mse: 13.49\n      baseline_dt2_obs_mse: 27.50\n      baseline_obs_gap: 2.04\n      baseline_dt1_reward_mae: 0.0102\n      baseline_dt2_reward_mae: 0.0159\n      baseline_reward_gap: 1.56\n      008d_dt1_obs_mse: 41.31\n      008d_dt2_obs_mse: 53.67\n      008d_obs_gap: 1.30\n      008d_dt1_reward_mae: 0.0568\n      008d_dt2_reward_mae: 0.1579\n      008d_reward_gap: 2.78\n      008f_dt1_obs_mse: 8.01\n      008f_dt2_obs_mse: 22.04\n      008f_obs_gap: 2.75\n      008f_dt1_reward_mae: 0.7469\n      008f_dt2_reward_mae: 0.7526\n      008f_reward_gap: 1.01\n    result_rationale: >\n      RSSM fidelity gap 是 CIVO 的机制基础。关键解读：\n      (1) Baseline obs_gap=2.04×：即使正常 RSSM 在 dt=2 上的 obs 误差也是 dt=1 的 2 倍——temporal abstraction 的固有代价。\n      (2) 008d 的 obs_gap=1.30× 看似「好」，但绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 的 3×——模型已崩塌，比率失去意义。\n      (3) 008d reward_gap=2.78×：trained dt_emb 使 reward head 对 dt 高度敏感，dt=2 reward error 是 dt=1 的 2.78 倍。\n          这精确的 reward conditioning 是 CIVO 正反馈循环的燃料。\n      (4) 008f reward_gap=1.01×：无 dt_emb 时 reward head 完全无法区分 dt=1/dt=2（gap≈1），\n          以 reward_MAE=0.75（baseline 75×）为代价彻底阻断 dt-specific exploitation。\n      论文中必须并排呈现绝对误差和比率，避免 008d 的低 obs_gap ratio 误导审稿人。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RSSM Fidelity 对比（必须同时报告绝对值和比率）\"\n        columns: [\"model\", \"dt1_obs_MSE\", \"dt2_obs_MSE\", \"obs_gap\", \"dt1_reward_MAE\", \"dt2_reward_MAE\", \"reward_gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"baseline\", 13.49, 27.50, \"2.04×\", 0.0102, 0.0159, \"1.56×\"]\n          - [\"008d (trained dt_emb)\", 41.31, 53.67, \"1.30×\", 0.0568, 0.1579, \"2.78×\"]\n          - [\"008f (no dt_emb)\", 8.01, 22.04, \"2.75×\", 0.7469, 0.7526, \"1.01×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Table 1 (paper): 三模型 RSSM fidelity 并排。绝对值 + 比率双重呈现。突出 008d 的 reward_gap=2.78× 作为 CIVO 机制证据。\"\n    analysis: >\n      RSSM fidelity analysis 是 C2 机制解释的量化基础。三个关键对照：\n      (1) 008d reward_gap=2.78× → dt_emb 使 reward 预测高度 dt-sensitive → exploitation channel;\n      (2) 008f reward_gap=1.01× → 去掉 dt_emb 彻底消除 dt-sensitivity → channel blocked;\n      (3) 008d obs_gap=1.30× 的误导性 → 论文需要双重呈现避免 reviewer 误读。\n\n  - name: \"Actor entropy analysis\"\n    plan_id: plan_031\n    description: >\n      从已有实验 metrics 中提取 actor_entropy 轨迹，区分健康 vs 崩溃 configs 的 entropy 动力学。\n    expected_results:\n      healthy_configs_entropy_trend: \"稳定在 -4.5 to -5.2 range (确定性策略，正常)\"\n      civo_collapsed_entropy_trend: \"↓ 下降 (-3.5→-4.9), 策略过度确定化 (exploitation)\"\n      pathway_b_collapsed_entropy_trend: \"↑ 上升 (-5.2→-3.8), 策略退化为随机\"\n      key_comparison:\n        008d_s0_entropy_55K: -4.879\n        008e_v3_s2_entropy_105K: -3.828\n        008a_s0_entropy_105K: -4.9\n        baseline_entropy_105K: -5.1\n      entropy_as_pathway_discriminator: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Actor entropy 是区分两种崩溃路径的关键指标：\n      Pathway A (CIVO)：critic 高估 → actor 对 over-valued actions 过度 exploit → entropy 下降 → 策略变确定但错误。\n      Pathway B (policy instability)：RSSM representation distortion → actor 收到不一致 gradient 信号 → entropy 上升 → 策略退化为近随机。\n      健康 configs 的 entropy 稳定反映 actor-critic 正常校准。\n      这三类轨迹在已有数据中已清晰可见（008d vs 008e_v3_s2 vs baseline），\n      系统性绘图将强化论文 Discussion 中的 dual-pathway 论述。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Actor entropy 三类轨迹\"\n        columns: [\"trajectory_type\", \"representative\", \"entropy_early\", \"entropy_late\", \"direction\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pathway A (CIVO)\", \"008d s0\", -3.47, -4.88, \"↓ exploitation\"]\n          - [\"Pathway B (instability)\", \"008e_v3 s2\", -5.21, -3.83, \"↑ randomization\"]\n          - [\"Healthy\", \"baseline / 008a\", -4.5, -5.1, \"→ stable\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Actor entropy vs training step, 三类轨迹分色。CIVO 路径（红色下降），instability 路径（橙色上升），健康路径（绿色稳定）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Actor entropy 分析为 C6 的 dual-pathway 论述提供量化支撑。\n      论文可用此图直观展示两种崩溃机制的定性差异。\n\n  - name: \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\"\n    plan_id: plan_032\n    description: >\n      从 checkpoint 中采样 V(s) 和 Monte Carlo return，绘制联合分布。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_distribution: \"V(s) 与 MC_return 紧密聚集在对角线，slight overshoot at 105K (v/e=0.66)\"\n      008d_distribution_pre_collapse: \"V(s) 分布右移（高估），MC_return 左移（性能下降），gap 扩大\"\n      008d_distribution_post_collapse: \"V(s) >> MC_return, 两个分布几乎不重叠\"\n      008a_distribution: \"V(s) 略低于 MC_return，类似 baseline 但压缩\"\n      tcn_sigma02_distribution: \"V(s) 与 MC_return 保持 baseline-like 对齐，NVE < 1.0\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      V(s) vs MC_return 分布是 v/e ratio 的高维展开。\n      CIVO 不仅是均值偏移——trained dt_emb 导致 V(s) 分布的右尾异常膨胀\n      （部分 states 被极端高估），这些 states 驱动 actor 学习错误 policy。\n      Distribution plot 比单一 ratio 更 informative，直接回应 Reviewer R3 (v/e ratio 是 crude proxy)。\n      TCN σ=0.2 的分布应与 baseline 高度一致——这是 NVE < 1.0× 的分布层面验证。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 2×2 grid of V(s) vs MC_return scatter plots at 55K。(a) baseline: tight diagonal; (b) 008d: V(s) shifted right; (c) 008a: slightly below diagonal; (d) TCN σ=0.2: baseline-like。\"\n    analysis: >\n      如果时间允许，此图显著增强 C2 + C8 论证。直接回应 R3 concern。\n      不作为核心 claim 的依据，但作为补充证据提升 rigor。\n\n  - name: \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\"\n    plan_id: plan_033\n    description: >\n      追踪 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 向量之间的 cosine similarity 随训练步数的演变。\n    expected_results:\n      initial_cosine_sim: \"~0.0 (random initialization, near-orthogonal)\"\n      008d_cosine_sim_trajectory: \"0→0.3→0.6→0.85 by 35K (rapid differentiation)\"\n      008d_cosine_sim_at_collapse: \"~0.85-0.90 (highly aligned but distinct)\"\n      008a_cosine_sim_trajectory: \"stays ~0.0-0.1 throughout (no differentiation)\"\n      008f_cosine_sim: \"n/a (no dt_embedding)\"\n      015b_cosine_sim: \"fixed ~0.0 (frozen, no update)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Trained dt_emb 在训练中逐渐学会区分 dt=1 和 dt=2（cosine sim 变化反映 embedding 空间演化）。\n      预测 cosine sim 在崩溃前快速变化，因 reward head 和 obs decoder 的梯度\n      驱动 dt_emb 向最大区分方向优化。\n      008a (unexposed) 的 cosine sim 保持近零，因训练数据中只有 dt=1 transitions，\n      dt=2 slot 从未接收有意义梯度。\n      这从 embedding 空间视角补充 RSSM fidelity analysis 的机制故事。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Cosine similarity of dt_emb(1) vs dt_emb(2) over training. 008d (red): rapid rise to 0.85; 008a (blue): flat near 0; 015b (gray): fixed at 0.\"\n    analysis: >\n      P2 优先级。如果时间充裕，为 C2 机制叙事增加 embedding 空间的直觉。\n      不是 submission 必需，但可在 appendix 中提供。\n\n  - name: \"NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\"\n    plan_id: plan_034\n    description: >\n      在所有已有 seed 数据上计算 1.3×, 1.5×, 1.7×, 2.0× 阈值的分类准确率和 AUROC。\n    expected_results:\n      threshold_1_3x:\n        accuracy: 0.88\n        false_positives: \"~2 (transient NVE spikes in untrained configs)\"\n        false_negatives: 0\n      threshold_1_5x:\n        accuracy: 0.94\n        false_positives: 0\n        false_negatives: \"~1 (borderline trained seed with early self-correction)\"\n        classification: \"15/16 correct\"\n      threshold_1_7x:\n        accuracy: 0.91\n        false_positives: 0\n        false_negatives: \"~2 (seeds with moderate peak NVE)\"\n      threshold_2_0x:\n        accuracy: 0.84\n        false_positives: 0\n        false_negatives: \"~3-4 (seeds that peaked 1.5-2.0×)\"\n      auroc: 0.969\n      best_threshold: \"1.5× (optimal F1)\"\n      temporal_constraint: \"valid at 35K+ steps only (baseline v/e < 0.087 at 25K → unstable ratios)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      NVE 1.5× 阈值在 35K+ 时间窗口内实现最佳分类性能：\n      (1) 高于 1.3×：减少 false positives（untrained configs 的 transient spikes 通常 < 1.3×，\n          但 009c 在 105K 达 1.14× 和 008f_s4 peak 1.41× 在更低阈值下可能触发 FP）；\n      (2) 低于 1.7×：保留 self-correcting seeds 的检出力\n          （009b peak 1.62× 和 008d_s3 onset 1.5× 在 1.7× 处会被漏检）。\n      AUROC 0.969 反映 trained vs untrained dt_emb 的 NVE 分布几乎不重叠。\n      时间限定（35K+）是关键：25K 时 baseline v/e 仅 0.087，微小绝对差异被放大为大比率\n      （009b@25K NVE=2.05× 实为 false positive if applied at 25K）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"NVE 阈值分类性能\"\n        columns: [\"threshold\", \"accuracy\", \"FP\", \"FN\", \"F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1.3×\", 0.88, 2, 0, 0.90]\n          - [\"1.5×\", 0.94, 0, 1, 0.95]\n          - [\"1.7×\", 0.91, 0, 2, 0.91]\n          - [\"2.0×\", 0.84, 0, 4, 0.83]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: ROC curve for NVE-based CIVO classification. AUC=0.969. Annotate optimal threshold at 1.5×.\"\n    analysis: >\n      NVE ≥ 1.5× at 35K+ 是论文推荐的 CIVO 诊断标准。\n      AUROC=0.969 跨 2 environments（best tier 下加 Cartpole 升至 3 env），\n      是 C2 最强统计结果。论文 Table 2 呈现。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Cartpole Swingup — 第三环境验证（非 locomotion）\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_050\n    description: >\n      非 locomotion 环境的 dt=1 baseline。Cartpole Swingup 的 reward structure\n      （height-based, 0-1000 range）和 dynamics（1D cart + 1D pole）与 locomotion 不同，\n      用于测试 CIVO 机制是否跨任务类型泛化。\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_105K: 780\n      seed0_eval_peak: 845\n      seed0_ve_ratio_stable: 0.65\n      seed1_eval_105K: 820\n      seed1_eval_peak: 870\n      seed1_ve_ratio_stable: 0.68\n      seed2_eval_105K: 755\n      seed2_eval_peak: 830\n      seed2_ve_ratio_stable: 0.63\n      cross_seed_eval_mean_105K: 785\n      cross_seed_eval_std: 33\n      convergence_step: \"~90K\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      DreamerV3 在 Cartpole Swingup 上表现良好，典型 eval ~800-870。\n      收敛快于 locomotion 任务（~90K vs ~120K），因状态空间低维（cart position + velocity + pole angle + angular velocity = 4D），\n      RSSM 学习高效。v/e ratio 稳定在 0.63-0.68，略低于 Walker（0.69-0.72），\n      因 Cartpole 的 sparse initial reward（swingup phase）导致 value 校准略慢。\n      跨 seed 方差小（SD~33），因任务确定性高（不像 locomotion 有 contact dynamics 噪声）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Cartpole baseline 建立非 locomotion 参考。eval ~785±33, v/e ~0.65。\n      为 plan_051/052 的 NVE 归一化提供基准。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_051\n    description: >\n      核心跨任务泛化测试：Cartpole 上 trained dt_emb 是否同样触发 CIVO？\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_peak: 520\n      seed0_eval_105K: 95\n      seed0_nve_peak: 3.2\n      seed0_collapse: true\n      seed0_collapse_onset: 55000\n      seed1_eval_peak: 610\n      seed1_eval_105K: 580\n      seed1_nve_peak: 1.85\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed1_self_correction: true\n      seed2_eval_peak: 480\n      seed2_eval_105K: 70\n      seed2_nve_peak: 4.5\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      seed2_collapse_onset: 45000\n      cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x: \"3/3\"\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"2/3\"\n      civo_severity: \"moderate (NVE 1.85-4.5×, between Walker 2-4× and Cheetah 8-70×)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      CIVO 机制是 architecture-level（RSSM fidelity gap + dt_embedding co-adaptation），\n      不依赖特定任务的 reward structure 或 dynamics 类型。\n      Cartpole 的 CIVO severity 预计介于 Walker 和 Cheetah 之间：\n      - 状态空间简单（4D）→ RSSM fidelity gap 适中 → NVE 不会达到 Cheetah 的极端水平；\n      - 但 reward landscape（swingup → balance 的 phase transition）使 dt>1 prediction error\n        在 critical states 被放大 → severity 略高于 Walker。\n      3/3 seeds 超 NVE 1.5× 阈值（100%），2/3 崩溃（~67%），\n      与 Walker (~50%) 和 Cheetah (100%) 一致的方向。\n      collapse rate 在非 locomotion 环境成立 → 机制泛化确认。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cartpole CIVO 全 seed\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_peak\", \"eval_105K\", \"nve_peak\", \"collapse\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0\", 520, 95, 3.2, \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"s1\", 610, 580, 1.85, \"No (self-corrected)\"]\n          - [\"s2\", 480, 70, 4.5, \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Cartpole CIVO learning curves — 3 seeds 叠加 baseline 虚线。与 Walker/Cheetah 同格式便于跨环境对比。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C1+C2 跨任务泛化确认。非 locomotion 环境仍 3/3 seeds NVE > 1.5×。\n      这将论文的 scope 从 \"locomotion-specific\" 扩展到 \"DreamerV3 architecture-level\"。\n      NVE 1.5× threshold 跨 3 environments 成立，强化 plan_034 的 AUROC。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_052\n    description: >\n      Cartpole 因果控制：去掉 dt_embedding 应消除 CIVO。\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_105K: 290\n      seed0_nve_max: 0.75\n      seed0_civo: false\n      seed1_eval_105K: 340\n      seed1_nve_max: 0.60\n      seed1_civo: false\n      seed2_eval_105K: 310\n      seed2_nve_max: 0.85\n      seed2_civo: false\n      cross_seed_nve_max: 0.85\n      cross_seed_civo_rate: \"0/3\"\n      vs_baseline_pct: \"~40% of baseline\"\n      reward_degradation: \"moderate (reward_MAE ~50-70× baseline)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      与 Walker 008f 和 Cheetah 024b 模式一致：\n      去掉 dt_embedding → CIVO 阻断（0/3 NVE > 1.5×），但 reward prediction 严重退化。\n      Cartpole 的 performance penalty（~40% baseline）介于 Walker（~45%）和 Cheetah（~14%）之间，\n      因 Cartpole reward structure 的中等复杂度。\n      NVE 保持 < 1.0×，critic 偏向低估而非高估。\n      跨 3 环境，no-dt-emb 的 CIVO 消除率为 100%（Walker 4/4, Cheetah 2/2, Cartpole 3/3 = 9/9）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"No-dt-emb 因果控制跨 3 环境汇总\"\n        columns: [\"environment\", \"seeds_tested\", \"nve_above_1.5x\", \"civo_rate\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker Walk\", \"4+\", \"0\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah Run\", \"2+\", \"0\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"Cartpole Swingup\", 3, 0, \"0%\"]\n          - [\"Total\", \"9+\", \"0\", \"0%\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      跨 3 环境的嵌入移除 → CIVO 消除（9/9 = 100%），\n      vs trained dt_emb → CIVO 触发（~8/9 seeds NVE > 1.5×）。\n      这是论文中最干净的因果证据。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Forward-pass intervention 方法验证（C8 核心）\n  # ============================================================\n  # 注：TCN/RAVE 实验不在 experiment_plan 中但在 registry 中。\n  # 以下 plan_060 是 forward-pass intervention 的替代方案。\n\n  - name: \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\"\n    plan_id: plan_060\n    description: >\n      监控 imagination rollout 中 RSSM prediction uncertainty，超阈值时截断。\n      与 TCN（已验证）互补的 forward-pass 干预思路。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_peak: 450\n      eval_105K: 380\n      nve_max: 1.8\n      nve_mean_65K_105K: 1.2\n      collapse: false\n      truncation_rate_at_105K: \"~30% of imagination steps truncated at dt=2\"\n      effective_horizon_reduction: \"H_eff ~12.5 (from H=15, due to truncation)\"\n      civo_reduction_vs_untreated: \"partial (NVE 1.8× vs untreated 2-4×)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Uncertainty-gated truncation 在 RSSM 预测不确定性高时缩短 imagination horizon。\n      这是 forward-pass 层面的干预——不修改 embedding 或梯度，而是限制不可靠 prediction 的使用范围。\n      预测部分有效（NVE 1.8× vs untreated 2-4×），因为：\n      (1) RSSM uncertainty 确实在 dt>1 步较高，truncation 减少了不可靠 predictions 对 value 的影响；\n      (2) 但 uncertainty calibration 不完美——RSSM 的 aleatoric/epistemic uncertainty 估计\n          可能滞后于实际 prediction error 的恶化，导致截断时机偏晚；\n      (3) truncation 减少有效 horizon，牺牲 long-horizon credit assignment。\n      相比 TCN σ=0.2 的完全 CIVO 预防（NVE < 1.0×），truncation 是 weaker intervention，\n      但提供 mechanistic insight：RSSM uncertainty 与 CIVO 风险正相关。\n      在 best tier 叙事中，truncation 作为 \"forward-pass intervention 有效性的独立确认\"，\n      而 TCN 是推荐的 principled mitigation。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig (appendix): Truncation rate vs training step。随训练推进，dt=2 imagination 被截断比例逐渐下降（RSSM improves），但 CIVO 已在早期种下。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Plan_060 在 best tier 中是辅助证据，非核心。\n      TCN 已占据 C8 的 primary mitigation 位置。\n      Truncation 的部分成功（NVE 从 2-4× 降至 ~1.8×）进一步确认 forward-pass 是正确的干预层级，\n      但 TCN 的 mechanism（降低 conditioning precision）比 truncation（缩短 horizon）更根本。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Hopper Hop — 第四环境（P2, stretch goal）\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\"\n    plan_id: plan_040\n    description: >\n      P2 stretch goal。Hopper Hop 是高难 locomotion 任务（需要单腿跳跃），\n      DreamerV3 baseline 性能有限。如完成，提供第四环境的 C1+C2 验证。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline:\n        seed0_eval_105K: 210\n        seed1_eval_105K: 250\n        seed2_eval_105K: 180\n        cross_seed_mean: 213\n        ve_ratio_stable: 0.55\n      trained_dt_emb:\n        seed0_eval_105K: 45\n        seed0_nve_peak: 5.2\n        seed0_collapse: true\n        seed1_eval_105K: 120\n        seed1_nve_peak: 2.8\n        seed1_collapse: false\n        seed2_eval_105K: 30\n        seed2_nve_peak: 7.1\n        seed2_collapse: true\n        cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x: \"3/3\"\n        cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"2/3\"\n      no_dt_emb:\n        seed0_eval_105K: 55\n        seed0_nve_max: 0.6\n        seed1_eval_105K: 70\n        seed1_nve_max: 0.45\n        seed2_eval_105K: 50\n        seed2_nve_max: 0.7\n        cross_seed_civo_rate: \"0/3\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Hopper Hop 是高难任务，DreamerV3 baseline 仅 ~200-250（满分 ~1000）。\n      CIVO 在 Hopper 上预计严重：\n      (1) 跳跃动力学高度非线性（contact/flight phase transitions），RSSM 在 dt>1 的 prediction error 大；\n      (2) 奖励稀疏（只有成功跳跃时获得高奖励），value overestimation 对 policy 影响更大；\n      (3) 低 baseline 性能意味着 CIVO 的相对破坏更 catastrophic。\n      NVE 预计 2.8-7.1×（介于 Walker 和 Cheetah 之间），3/3 超 1.5× 阈值。\n      No-dt-emb 控制：0/3 CIVO，eval ~55（baseline 的 ~26%），严重 reward degradation。\n      如完成，将 cross-env validation 扩展到 4 environments（Walker, Cheetah, Cartpole, Hopper）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"跨 4 环境 NVE 1.5× threshold 汇总 (best tier)\"\n        columns: [\"environment\", \"trained_above_1.5x\", \"untrained_below_1.5x\", \"total_correct\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker Walk\", \"5/5\", \"4/4\", \"9/9\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah Run\", \"3/3\", \"2/2\", \"5/5\"]\n          - [\"Cartpole Swingup\", \"3/3\", \"3/3\", \"6/6\"]\n          - [\"Hopper Hop\", \"3/3\", \"3/3\", \"6/6\"]\n          - [\"Total\", \"14/14\", \"12/12\", \"26/26\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      如完成，26/26 = 100% classification accuracy 跨 4 环境，\n      AUROC→1.0。但 plan_040 是 P2，best tier 不需要此数据——\n      3 环境（Walker + Cheetah + Cartpole）已足够支撑 cross-env generalization claim。\n      Hopper 数据若存在可放入 appendix 作为额外 robustness evidence。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Best tier 叙事整合与 claim 支撑总结\n  # ============================================================\n\n  # 以下为 best tier 下所有 8 claims 的数据支撑度评估\n\nclaim_support_summary:\n  C1_variable_rate_degradation:\n    status: \"STRONG\"\n    environments: 3\n    total_configs: \"7+\"\n    evidence: \"dt=2 和 dt=4 在 Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole 上全部退化。无正面案例。\"\n  C2_trained_dt_emb_civo_trigger:\n    status: \"STRONG\"\n    nve_threshold_auroc: 0.969\n    cross_env_seeds: \"14/14 trained > 1.5× across 3 envs\"\n    causal_control: \"9/9 no-dt-emb seeds < 1.5×\"\n    evidence: \"NVE≥1.5× 诊断标记跨环境 100% 分离。\"\n  C3_untrained_emb_protection:\n    status: \"STRONG\"\n    walker_seeds: \"3/3 NVE < 1.0×\"\n    cheetah_seeds: \"3/3 NVE < 0.5×\"\n    mechanism: \"value growth suppression structural, not transient\"\n  C4_dt_amplification:\n    status: \"MODERATE\"\n    evidence: \"dt=1 > dt=2 > dt=4 monotonic in Walker. Only 2 dt values tested.\"\n  C5_horizon_secondary:\n    status: \"MODERATE\"\n    evidence: \"subsample ≠ root cause (008c stable, 008e_v3 stable with subsample ON)\"\n  C6_dt1_imag_partial:\n    status: \"STRONG (partially falsified → dual pathway finding)\"\n    collapse_rate: \"2/4 seeds (50%, same as dt=2)\"\n    pathway_A: \"CIVO (value-driven, entropy ↓) — eliminated by dt=1 restriction\"\n    pathway_B: \"policy instability (eval-driven, entropy ↑) — NOT eliminated\"\n  C7_sgs_failure:\n    status: \"STRONG\"\n    total_seeds: 17\n    sgs_variants: 3\n    environments: 2\n    success_rate: \"1/17 (with value collapse side effect)\"\n    embedding_removal_rate: \"5/5 prevention\"\n    core_finding: \"gradient magnitude ≠ causal importance; backward-pass categorically insufficient\"\n  C8_forward_pass_intervention:\n    status: \"STRONG (best tier: cross-seed + cross-env validated)\"\n    tcn_walker_sigma02: \"2/2 seeds NVE < 1.0× throughout\"\n    tcn_cheetah_sigma05: \"NVE 1.5-4.0× (2-5× reduction from untreated 8-108×)\"\n    dose_response: \"σ scales with environment CIVO severity\"\n    cross_env_prevention: \"≥ 3/4 seeds\"\n    rave_failure: \"EMA anchor pollution → negative\"\n    paper_upgrade: \"diagnosis → diagnosis + principled mitigation\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":752,"cache_read_input_tokens":86599,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":752},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7bacc094-afad-45f1-94e3-eeb8a582e328","uuid":"81e48ac3-c67e-4a0b-b4ba-71faa9584cb5"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":603414,"duration_api_ms":605629,"num_turns":5,"result":"Now I have the full picture. Let me construct the comprehensive best-tier predictions for all 20 planned experiments (excluding 3 CANCELLED ones = 17 planned).\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Forward-pass intervention thesis cross-seed + cross-env validated — 诊断论文升级为 diagnosis + principled mitigation。\n  核心叙事：backward-pass 干预全面失败（C7, 17 seeds, 3 SGS 变体, 2 environments）→ forward-pass noise injection 成功（C8, TCN）\n  → 确证 CIVO 是 forward-pass representational damage 而非 gradient contamination。\n  TCN σ=0.2 在 Walker 跨 seed 复现（2/2 seeds NVE < 1.0×），TCN σ=0.5 在 Cheetah 成功（NVE 从 8-108× 降至 1.5-4×）。\n  Dose-response（σ 与 untreated CIVO severity 正相关）提供额外机制洞察。\n  标题更新为 \"Diagnosing and Mitigating Value Overestimation from Temporal Abstraction in DreamerV3\"。\n  C1-C8 全文保留，8 claims 全部有充分数据支撑。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Walker Walk — 多 seed 扩展（C2/C3/C6 验证）\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_011\n    description: >\n      复制 008d（subsample ON + trained dt_emb + H=8）崩溃模式。\n      seed 1 = exp_009e（已完成），seed 2 = exp_009b（已完成）。\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_009e_008d_walker_s1\n      seed1_eval_return_105K: 131.08\n      seed1_nve_peak: 4.12\n      seed1_nve_peak_step: 55000\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed1_collapse_type: \"classic CIVO — value-driven, entropy ↓\"\n      seed1_value_mean_105K: 135.37\n      seed2_exp_id: exp_009b_008d_walker_s2\n      seed2_eval_return_105K: 267.93\n      seed2_nve_peak: 2.05\n      seed2_nve_peak_step: 25000\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed2_self_correction: true\n      seed2_value_mean_105K: 67.27\n      cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x: \"2/2 seeds\"\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"1/2 (stochastic)\"\n      nve_threshold_classification: \"2/2 correct (both > 1.5×)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      两个 seed 均产生 NVE>1.5× episode，确证 trained dt_emb 可靠触发病态 value overestimation。\n      Seed 1 NVE 在 35K-55K 连续 3 个 checkpoint 维持 >1.5×（1.71→2.09→4.12），锁定正反馈循环→崩溃。\n      Seed 2 NVE 在 45K 达 1.62× 但立即回落（55K=1.41→65K=0.94），value 自修正→无崩溃。\n      差异源于早期训练随机性（initialization + data sampling order）决定 \"point of no return\" 是否被触发。\n      机制一致：trained dt_emb 使 RSSM 和 critic 对精确 dt 信号过度 co-adaptation，\n      但 RSSM 在 dt>1 的 prediction 质量不足以支撑这种精度 → value 系统性高估。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008d 跨 seed NVE 对比\"\n        columns: [\"step\", \"seed1_nve\", \"seed1_eval\", \"seed2_nve\", \"seed2_eval\"]\n        rows:\n          - [25000, 1.78, 167.2, 2.05, 141.1]\n          - [35000, 1.71, 146.3, 1.24, 164.1]\n          - [45000, 2.09, 140.8, 1.62, 141.0]\n          - [55000, 4.12, 82.7, 1.41, 172.3]\n          - [65000, 1.23, 250.0, 0.94, 209.2]\n          - [105000, 1.57, 131.1, 0.38, 267.9]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双 seed NVE 时序曲线。Seed 1 NVE 持续上升→崩溃（红），Seed 2 NVE 瞬态脉冲→自修正（蓝）。1.5× 水平虚线标记病态阈值。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C2 诊断标记确立：NVE≥1.5× 在 trained dt_emb 下 2/2 seeds 出现（100%），\n      在 untrained/absent dt_emb 下 0/2 seeds 出现（0%）。4/4 完美分离。\n      崩溃本身是随机的（1/2），但诊断信号是确定的。\n      这是论文 C2 最强定量结果。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_012\n    description: >\n      复制 008f（subsample ON + dt_embed_dim=0 + H=8）因果控制。\n      seed 1 = exp_009f（原运行被 killed，需重跑），seed 2 = exp_009c（已完成）。\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_009f_008f_walker_s1_rerun\n      seed1_eval_return_105K: 380\n      seed1_nve_max_35Kplus: 0.85\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed1_value_self_correction: true\n      seed1_trend: \"zigzag 恢复，类似 008f s0 (503@105K)\"\n      seed2_exp_id: exp_009c_008f_walker_s2\n      seed2_eval_return_105K: 148.34\n      seed2_nve_max_35Kplus: 1.14\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed2_trend: \"peak 359@75K then declined — no CIVO but performance unstable\"\n      cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x: \"0/2 seeds\"\n      supplementary_seeds:\n        seed3_exp_id: exp_008f_s3_no_dt_embed_walker\n        seed3_eval_final: 363.8\n        seed3_nve_peak: \"< 1.5×\"\n        seed4_exp_id: exp_008f_s4\n        seed4_eval_105K: 306.5\n        seed4_nve_peak: 1.41\n      all_seeds_below_1_5x: \"4/4 (s0=0.97, s2=1.14, s3<1.5, s4=1.41)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      去掉 dt_embedding 后，critic 无法利用精确 dt 信号进行系统性 co-adaptation。\n      Reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 75×）说明 reward head 完全丧失 dt 区分能力（reward gap=1.01×），\n      但这恰好阻断了 CIVO 正反馈循环的入口——无精确 conditioning → 无 exploitation。\n      4 个 seed 全部 NVE < 1.5×，与 008d 的 100% 超标形成完美对照。\n      性能波动大（148-503 range）因 reward 预测退化，但均不崩溃。\n      Seed 1 重跑预测 ~380 eval，基于 008f 四个 seed 的 eval 分布：\n      s0=503, s2=148, s3=364, s4=307 → 中位数 ~335, IQR [270, 420]。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008f (no dt_emb) 全 seed 汇总\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_105K\", \"nve_max_35K+\", \"collapse\", \"civo\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0\", 503, 0.97, \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s1 (pred)\", 380, 0.85, \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s2\", 148, 1.14, \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s3\", 364, \"< 1.5\", \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s4\", 307, 1.41, \"No\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      因果控制完全闭合：dt_embed_dim=0 → 0/4+ seeds 超 NVE 1.5× 阈值。\n      008f 角色是因果控制（证明 \"无 dt_embedding → 无 CIVO\"），不是推荐方案。\n      性能退化（vs baseline -45% 至 -84%）不影响因果结论。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_014\n    description: >\n      008e_v3（trained dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=1 imagination + H=15）多 seed 验证。\n      seed 1（已完成：成功），seed 2（已完成：崩溃）。\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_008e_v3_walker_s1\n      seed1_eval_return_105K: 869.9\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.80\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed1_vs_baseline: \"-5.0%\"\n      seed2_exp_id: exp_008e_v3_walker_s2\n      seed2_eval_return_105K: 137.0\n      seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      seed2_collapse_type: \"non-CIVO policy instability (eval-driven, entropy ↑)\"\n      seed2_actor_entropy_85K_to_105K: \"-5.21 → -3.83 (策略变随机)\"\n      collapse_rate: \"1/2 independent seeds\"\n      mitigation_verdict: \"PARTIALLY FALSIFIED — dt=1 imag eliminates Pathway A but not Pathway B\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Seed 1 在 dt=1 imagination 下 NVE 全程 0.72-0.80×（远低于 1.5× 阈值），\n      eval 单调上升至 869.9（95% baseline）。dt=1 限制成功阻断经典 CIVO（Pathway A）。\n      Seed 2 的崩溃机制与经典 CIVO 定性不同：value 变化温和（339→384→340, ±13%）\n      但 eval 先跌（715→452→137, -81%），NVE 高值是 eval 分母崩溃的结果而非 value 爆炸的原因。\n      Actor entropy 从 -5.21 升至 -3.83（策略从确定变随机），与 008d 的 entropy 下降（策略变确定→exploitation）相反。\n      这是 Pathway B：trained dt_embedding 通过 training data 中 dt>1 transitions 的存在，\n      即使 imagination 不使用 dt>1，仍对 RSSM latent representation 施加 subtle distortion，\n      在某些 seed 的初始化条件下触发 policy instability。\n      009a baseline s2 在同一步数完全稳定（618→596→836），排除 seed 脆弱假说。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008e_v3 两种崩溃路径对比\"\n        columns: [\"feature\", \"seed1_healthy\", \"seed2_collapsed\", \"008d_s0_classic_CIVO\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"eval_105K\", 869.9, 137.0, 82.7]\n          - [\"nve_105K\", 0.80, 3.78, 4.12]\n          - [\"value_change_85K→105K\", \"+106.6 (+30%)\", \"+0.5 (+0.1%)\", \"+77.7 (+130%)\"]\n          - [\"eval_change_85K→105K\", \"+212.6 (+32%)\", \"-578.2 (-81%)\", \"-64.2 (-44%)\"]\n          - [\"nve_driver\", \"n/a\", \"eval 分母崩溃\", \"value 分子爆炸\"]\n          - [\"actor_entropy_trend\", \"stable (-5.2)\", \"↑ rising (-5.2→-3.8)\", \"↓ falling (-3.5→-4.9)\"]\n          - [\"pathway\", \"none\", \"B (policy instability)\", \"A (classic CIVO)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 008e_v3 seed 1 vs seed 2 双面板。上：eval curves（seed 1 上升，seed 2 崩溃）。下：actor_entropy（seed 1 稳定，seed 2 发散）。标注 Pathway A vs B 差异。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C6 核心发现：trained dt_embedding 通过至少两条路径创造脆弱性。\n      dt=1 imagination 消除 Pathway A（critic 在 imagination 中不使用 dt>1 → 无 CIVO 正反馈循环），\n      但不消除 Pathway B（training data 中 dt>1 transitions 影响 RSSM representation quality）。\n      论文措辞：\"Restricting imagination to dt=1 does not reliably prevent collapse\n      in the presence of trained dt-embedding.\"\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: plan_013\n    description: >\n      008a（subsample OFF + trained dt_emb unexposed to dt>1 + H=15）跨 seed 复制。\n      实质等价于 untrained dt_emb（从未接触 dt>1 数据，embedding 学不到有意义的 dt 区分）。\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_008a_unexposed_s1\n      seed1_eval_return_105K: 630.91\n      seed1_ve_ratio_105K: 0.43\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.66\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed1_value_suppression: true\n      seed2_exp_id: exp_008a_unexposed_s2\n      seed2_eval_return_105K: 899.4\n      seed2_ve_ratio_105K: 0.333\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.51\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed2_value_suppression: true\n      seed0_reference:\n        eval_105K: 777.66\n        nve_105K: 0.59\n      cross_seed_nve_range: \"0.51-0.66 (all < 1.0×)\"\n      cross_seed_eval_range: \"631-899\"\n      vs_baseline_range: \"-2% to -31%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      subsample OFF 意味着 training data 中不含 dt>1 transitions，dt_embedding 虽有参数但从未被暴露于\n      需要区分 dt=1 vs dt=2 的信号。等价效果：embedding 保持近随机初始化状态，\n      不会形成精确 dt conditioning → critic 无法 exploit dt-specific prediction error。\n      NVE 全程 < 1.0× 确证 value growth 被结构性压制。\n      跨 seed eval 方差大（631-899）反映任务随机性，不影响 CIVO 诊断结论。\n      Seed 2 (899.4) 接近 baseline (916)，说明在好的初始化下 unexposed dt_emb 几乎无性能损失。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008a (unexposed) 全 seed 汇总\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_105K\", \"nve_105K\", \"vs_baseline\", \"collapse\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0\", 777.7, 0.59, \"-15.1%\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s1\", 630.9, 0.66, \"-31.1%\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"s2\", 899.4, 0.51, \"-1.8%\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      C3 跨 seed 确认：3/3 seeds NVE < 1.0×，无 CIVO。\n      Value growth 压制是结构性的（NVE 随训练远离 1.0 而非趋近），\n      机制：未接触 dt>1 数据 → dt_embedding 无法学到有意义的 temporal 区分 → 阻断 co-adaptation。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\"\n    plan_id: plan_015\n    description: >\n      dt_embedding 参数 requires_grad=False，保持随机初始化不训练。\n      其余与 008d 完全一致。诊断：dt_emb 的 TRAINING 是否是 CIVO 必要条件？\n    expected_results:\n      exp_id: exp_015b_frozen_dt_emb\n      eval_return_105K: 204.2\n      nve_85K: 0.467\n      nve_95K: 0.394\n      nve_105K: 0.42\n      nve_max_35Kplus: 0.47\n      collapse: false\n      collapse_type: \"gradient starvation — distinct from CIVO\"\n      actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n      actor_entropy_105K: -4.855\n      gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n      failure_mode: \"NVE << 1.0 (critic under-estimates), actor_loss→0, eval volatile 80-238\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Frozen dt_emb 传入随机固定向量给 RSSM 和 heads，但不接收梯度更新。\n      结果是一种不同于 CIVO 的失败模式：\n      (1) NVE 0.39-0.47（远低于 1.0×）— critic 系统性低估 value（与 CIVO 的高估相反）；\n      (2) actor_loss → 0（梯度饥饿）— actor 无法从不校准的 critic 获得有意义学习信号；\n      (3) eval 在 80-238 间剧烈震荡，无稳定收敛。\n      这确认：dt_emb 的 TRAINING（而非 mere presence）是 CIVO 必要条件。\n      随机固定 embedding 不提供可 exploit 的精确 dt 信息 → 无 CIVO，\n      但也不提供有用时间信息 → 性能极差。\n      与 008d（trained, CIVO 崩溃）和 008f（absent, 无 CIVO 但 reward 退化）构成 2×2 矩阵第三象限。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"dt_embedding 状态 vs 失败模式 2×2 矩阵\"\n        columns: [\"dt_emb_state\", \"present_dt2_data\", \"absent_dt2_data\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trained\", \"008d: CIVO 崩溃 (NVE 2-4×)\", \"008a: value suppression (NVE 0.5-0.7×)\"]\n          - [\"Frozen (random)\", \"015b: gradient starvation (NVE 0.4×)\", \"n/a (no dt_emb to freeze)\"]\n          - [\"Absent (dim=0)\", \"008f: no CIVO, reward degraded (NVE 0.3-1.1×)\", \"= baseline\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      2×2 矩阵闭合。CIVO 只在 [Trained × Present dt>1 data] 象限出现。\n      Frozen dt_emb 创造第三种失败模式（梯度饥饿），支持\"dt_emb training 是 CIVO 必要条件\"的强论断。\n      论文中作为 C2 的补充机制证据。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\"\n    plan_id: plan_016\n    description: >\n      扩展 008e_v3 到 4 个 seed，收窄崩溃概率估计。\n    expected_results:\n      seed3_exp_id: exp_008e_v3_s3\n      seed3_eval_return_105K: 92.7\n      seed3_nve_peak: 4.02\n      seed3_collapse: true\n      seed3_collapse_onset: \"85K-95K\"\n      seed4_exp_id: exp_008e_v3_s4\n      seed4_eval_return_105K: 899.3\n      seed4_nve_peak: 0.99\n      seed4_collapse: false\n      four_seed_collapse_rate: \"2/4 (50%)\"\n      four_seed_healthy_eval_mean: 884.6\n      four_seed_collapsed_eval_mean: 114.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      4 个 seed 中 2 个崩溃（s2, s3）、2 个健康（s1, s4），崩溃率 50%。\n      与 008d（dt=2 imagination）的 ~50% 崩溃率一致，确认 dt=1 imagination 未降低崩溃概率。\n      崩溃的 seed 均表现出 Pathway B 特征（eval-driven 而非 value-driven），\n      健康的 seed NVE 全程 < 1.0×。\n      二项分布 95% CI for p=0.5 at n=4: [0.07, 0.93]，样本量不足以精确估计 p，\n      但 2/4 与 008d 的 ~1/2 一致性强化\"dt=1 imagination 不改善崩溃概率\"的结论。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008e_v3 (dt=1 imag) 全 4 seed 汇总\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_105K\", \"nve_peak\", \"collapse\", \"pathway\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s1\", 869.9, 0.80, \"No\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"s2\", 137.0, 3.78, \"Yes\", \"B (eval-driven)\"]\n          - [\"s3\", 92.7, 4.02, \"Yes\", \"B (eval-driven)\"]\n          - [\"s4\", 899.3, 0.99, \"No\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      C6 最终状态：dt=1 imagination 崩溃率 2/4 = 50%，与 dt=2 一致。\n      论文报告：dt=1 restriction 不是有效 mitigation，trained dt_emb 本身即脆弱性来源。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Cheetah Run — 跨环境验证\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_020\n    description: >\n      Cheetah Run dt=1 baseline，建立第二环境参考性能和 v/e 校准。\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_exp_id: exp_023a_cheetah_baseline_s0\n      seed0_eval_final: 624.7\n      seed0_eval_peak: 624.7\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_023b_cheetah_baseline_s1\n      seed1_eval_final: 520.3\n      seed1_eval_peak: 572.9\n      seed2_exp_id: exp_023_cheetah_baseline_s2\n      seed2_eval_final: 645.4\n      additional_seeds:\n        seed3_eval_final: 642.1\n        seed4_eval_final: 537.0\n      cross_seed_eval_mean: 593.9\n      cross_seed_eval_std: 56.8\n      ve_ratio_stable: \"0.50-0.70\"\n      convergence_step: \"~180K\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cheetah Run 是 DMC locomotion 标准环境，DreamerV3 在此任务上收敛到 ~520-650 range。\n      跨 seed 方差较大（std ~57），属于 Cheetah Run 的正常变异范围。\n      v/e ratio 稳定在 0.50-0.70，低于 Walker（0.69-0.72），因 Cheetah 的 reward scale 不同。\n      收敛速度略慢于 Walker（~180K vs ~120K），因 Cheetah 的动作空间和动力学更复杂。\n      5 个 seed 提供充分的 NVE 归一化基准。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Cheetah baseline 建立。均值 ~594, SD ~57。用于归一化 CIVO 实验的 NVE。\n      与 Walker baseline (~940) 的量级差异不影响 NVE 归一化后的 cross-env 可比性。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_021\n    description: >\n      Cheetah 环境的 CIVO 触发实验。预期 CIVO 严重程度远超 Walker（因 Cheetah RSSM fidelity gap 更大）。\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_exp_id: exp_010b_cheetah_civo_trigger_s0\n      seed0_eval_105K: 0.83\n      seed0_nve_105K: 70.64\n      seed0_civo_severity: \"catastrophic\"\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_010b_cheetah_civo_trigger\n      seed1_eval_final: 51.7\n      seed1_eval_peak: 321.9\n      seed1_nve_peak: 8.27\n      seed1_civo_severity: \"severe\"\n      seed2_predicted:\n        eval_peak: 280\n        eval_105K: 15\n        nve_peak: 45\n        civo_severity: \"catastrophic\"\n      cross_seed_nve_range: \"8.3-70.6× (vs Walker 2-4×)\"\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"3/3\"\n      civo_severity_vs_walker: \"10-35× more severe\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cheetah Run 的 CIVO 严重程度远超 Walker，原因：\n      (1) Cheetah 动力学更复杂（6-DOF vs Walker 的 2-DOF），RSSM 在 dt>1 的 prediction error 更大；\n      (2) reward landscape 更陡峭（速度奖励的梯度更大），微小 state error 对 reward 影响放大；\n      (3) 这两者叠加使 trained dt_emb 的 co-adaptation 更剧烈。\n      结果是 NVE 达到 8-70× 量级（Walker 仅 2-4×），所有 seed 均崩溃（无自修正）。\n      Seed 2 预测 NVE~45×，eval 降至 ~15（近随机策略），基于 s0 和 s1 的 severity 分布。\n      这为 TCN dose-response 假说提供关键对照：\n      Cheetah 需要 σ=0.5（而非 Walker 的 σ=0.2）才能匹配其更高的 CIVO severity。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cheetah CIVO severity vs Walker\"\n        columns: [\"environment\", \"nve_range\", \"collapse_rate\", \"typical_onset\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker Walk\", \"2-4×\", \"~50% (3/6 seeds)\", \"35-55K\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah Run\", \"8-70×\", \"100% (3/3 seeds)\", \"45-65K\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Walker vs Cheetah NVE 时序对比（log scale Y 轴）。Cheetah NVE 峰值比 Walker 高 1-2 个数量级。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cheetah 的更高 CIVO severity 支持 dose-response 论题：\n      untreated severity 越高 → 需要更大 σ（噪声剂量）来抑制。\n      Walker CIVO 轻（2-4×）→ σ=0.2 足够；Cheetah CIVO 重（8-70×）→ σ=0.2 不够（exp_030a 确认），需 σ=0.5。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_022\n    description: >\n      Cheetah 因果控制：去掉 dt_embedding 应消除 CIVO。\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_exp_id: exp_024b_cheetah_no_dt_emb_s0\n      seed0_eval_final: 96.5\n      seed0_nve_peak: 0.2\n      seed0_civo: false\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_024b_cheetah_no_dt_emb_s1\n      seed1_eval_final: 77.3\n      seed1_nve_peak: 0.1\n      seed1_civo: false\n      seed2_predicted:\n        eval_105K: 85\n        nve_peak: 0.15\n        civo: false\n      cross_seed_nve_max: 0.2\n      cross_seed_civo_rate: \"0/3\"\n      vs_baseline_pct: \"~14% of baseline\"\n      reward_mae_vs_baseline: \"~60-80×\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      与 Walker 008f 模式一致：去掉 dt_embedding 彻底阻断 CIVO（0/3 seeds NVE > 1.5×）。\n      性能极差（~14% baseline）因 reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2 transitions，\n      reward_MAE 预计为 baseline 的 60-80×（Cheetah reward range 更大 → 绝对误差更大）。\n      NVE 极低（0.1-0.2×）反映 critic 系统性低估。\n      Cheetah 的因果控制结论与 Walker 完全一致：\n      dt_embedding 是 CIVO 的必要条件，跨环境成立。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-env 因果控制确认。Walker + Cheetah 共 7+ seeds 的 no-dt_emb 实验，\n      全部 NVE < 1.5×。嵌入移除 → CIVO 消除是环境无关的。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_023\n    description: >\n      Cheetah 的 unexposed dt_emb（subsample OFF）实验，验证 C3 value suppression 跨环境成立。\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_exp_id: exp_008a_cheetah_unexposed_s0\n      seed0_eval_105K: 532.35\n      seed0_nve_105K: 0.49\n      seed0_value_suppression: true\n      seed1_exp_id: exp_008a_cheetah_unexposed_s1\n      seed1_eval_105K: 504.38\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.478\n      seed1_value_suppression: true\n      seed2_predicted:\n        eval_105K: 520\n        nve_105K: 0.50\n        value_suppression: true\n      cross_seed_nve_range: \"0.48-0.50\"\n      cross_seed_eval_mean: 519\n      vs_baseline_pct: \"~87% of Cheetah baseline\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Unexposed dt_emb（subsample OFF → 无 dt>1 training data）在 Cheetah 上同样产生 value suppression。\n      NVE 稳定在 ~0.48-0.50×（Cheetah baseline v/e 较低导致 NVE 比 Walker 的 0.51-0.66 更接近 0.5）。\n      Performance 保持在 baseline 的 ~87%，与 Walker 的 008a（85% baseline）高度一致。\n      这确认：value growth suppression 是环境无关的结构性效应，\n      不依赖于 Walker-specific 的 reward 或 dynamics 特征。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Unexposed dt_emb 跨环境一致性\"\n        columns: [\"environment\", \"eval_vs_baseline\", \"nve_range\", \"seeds_below_1x\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker Walk\", \"85% (778/916)\", \"0.51-0.66\", \"3/3\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah Run\", \"87% (519/594)\", \"0.48-0.50\", \"3/3\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      C3 跨环境确认。两个环境中 unexposed dt_emb 均产生:\n      (1) NVE < 1.0×（value growth suppression），(2) 保持 ~85-87% baseline 性能。\n      机制一致：无 dt>1 exposure → embedding 学不到有意义的 temporal 区分 → 阻断 co-adaptation。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 诊断分析（0 GPU）\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\"\n    plan_id: plan_030\n    description: >\n      量化 RSSM 在 dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions 上的预测质量差异。\n      已完成（exp_rssm_fidelity_analysis）。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_dt1_obs_mse: 13.49\n      baseline_dt2_obs_mse: 27.50\n      baseline_obs_gap: 2.04\n      baseline_dt1_reward_mae: 0.0102\n      baseline_dt2_reward_mae: 0.0159\n      baseline_reward_gap: 1.56\n      008d_dt1_obs_mse: 41.31\n      008d_dt2_obs_mse: 53.67\n      008d_obs_gap: 1.30\n      008d_dt1_reward_mae: 0.0568\n      008d_dt2_reward_mae: 0.1579\n      008d_reward_gap: 2.78\n      008f_dt1_obs_mse: 8.01\n      008f_dt2_obs_mse: 22.04\n      008f_obs_gap: 2.75\n      008f_dt1_reward_mae: 0.7469\n      008f_dt2_reward_mae: 0.7526\n      008f_reward_gap: 1.01\n    result_rationale: >\n      RSSM fidelity gap 是 CIVO 的机制基础。关键解读：\n      (1) Baseline obs_gap=2.04×：即使正常 RSSM 在 dt=2 上的 obs 误差也是 dt=1 的 2 倍——temporal abstraction 的固有代价。\n      (2) 008d 的 obs_gap=1.30× 看似「好」，但绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 的 3×——模型已崩塌，比率失去意义。\n      (3) 008d reward_gap=2.78×：trained dt_emb 使 reward head 对 dt 高度敏感，dt=2 reward error 是 dt=1 的 2.78 倍。\n          这精确的 reward conditioning 是 CIVO 正反馈循环的燃料。\n      (4) 008f reward_gap=1.01×：无 dt_emb 时 reward head 完全无法区分 dt=1/dt=2（gap≈1），\n          以 reward_MAE=0.75（baseline 75×）为代价彻底阻断 dt-specific exploitation。\n      论文中必须并排呈现绝对误差和比率，避免 008d 的低 obs_gap ratio 误导审稿人。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RSSM Fidelity 对比（必须同时报告绝对值和比率）\"\n        columns: [\"model\", \"dt1_obs_MSE\", \"dt2_obs_MSE\", \"obs_gap\", \"dt1_reward_MAE\", \"dt2_reward_MAE\", \"reward_gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"baseline\", 13.49, 27.50, \"2.04×\", 0.0102, 0.0159, \"1.56×\"]\n          - [\"008d (trained dt_emb)\", 41.31, 53.67, \"1.30×\", 0.0568, 0.1579, \"2.78×\"]\n          - [\"008f (no dt_emb)\", 8.01, 22.04, \"2.75×\", 0.7469, 0.7526, \"1.01×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Table 1 (paper): 三模型 RSSM fidelity 并排。绝对值 + 比率双重呈现。突出 008d 的 reward_gap=2.78× 作为 CIVO 机制证据。\"\n    analysis: >\n      RSSM fidelity analysis 是 C2 机制解释的量化基础。三个关键对照：\n      (1) 008d reward_gap=2.78× → dt_emb 使 reward 预测高度 dt-sensitive → exploitation channel;\n      (2) 008f reward_gap=1.01× → 去掉 dt_emb 彻底消除 dt-sensitivity → channel blocked;\n      (3) 008d obs_gap=1.30× 的误导性 → 论文需要双重呈现避免 reviewer 误读。\n\n  - name: \"Actor entropy analysis\"\n    plan_id: plan_031\n    description: >\n      从已有实验 metrics 中提取 actor_entropy 轨迹，区分健康 vs 崩溃 configs 的 entropy 动力学。\n    expected_results:\n      healthy_configs_entropy_trend: \"稳定在 -4.5 to -5.2 range (确定性策略，正常)\"\n      civo_collapsed_entropy_trend: \"↓ 下降 (-3.5→-4.9), 策略过度确定化 (exploitation)\"\n      pathway_b_collapsed_entropy_trend: \"↑ 上升 (-5.2→-3.8), 策略退化为随机\"\n      key_comparison:\n        008d_s0_entropy_55K: -4.879\n        008e_v3_s2_entropy_105K: -3.828\n        008a_s0_entropy_105K: -4.9\n        baseline_entropy_105K: -5.1\n      entropy_as_pathway_discriminator: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Actor entropy 是区分两种崩溃路径的关键指标：\n      Pathway A (CIVO)：critic 高估 → actor 对 over-valued actions 过度 exploit → entropy 下降 → 策略变确定但错误。\n      Pathway B (policy instability)：RSSM representation distortion → actor 收到不一致 gradient 信号 → entropy 上升 → 策略退化为近随机。\n      健康 configs 的 entropy 稳定反映 actor-critic 正常校准。\n      这三类轨迹在已有数据中已清晰可见（008d vs 008e_v3_s2 vs baseline），\n      系统性绘图将强化论文 Discussion 中的 dual-pathway 论述。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Actor entropy 三类轨迹\"\n        columns: [\"trajectory_type\", \"representative\", \"entropy_early\", \"entropy_late\", \"direction\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pathway A (CIVO)\", \"008d s0\", -3.47, -4.88, \"↓ exploitation\"]\n          - [\"Pathway B (instability)\", \"008e_v3 s2\", -5.21, -3.83, \"↑ randomization\"]\n          - [\"Healthy\", \"baseline / 008a\", -4.5, -5.1, \"→ stable\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Actor entropy vs training step, 三类轨迹分色。CIVO 路径（红色下降），instability 路径（橙色上升），健康路径（绿色稳定）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Actor entropy 分析为 C6 的 dual-pathway 论述提供量化支撑。\n      论文可用此图直观展示两种崩溃机制的定性差异。\n\n  - name: \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\"\n    plan_id: plan_032\n    description: >\n      从 checkpoint 中采样 V(s) 和 Monte Carlo return，绘制联合分布。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_distribution: \"V(s) 与 MC_return 紧密聚集在对角线，slight overshoot at 105K (v/e=0.66)\"\n      008d_distribution_pre_collapse: \"V(s) 分布右移（高估），MC_return 左移（性能下降），gap 扩大\"\n      008d_distribution_post_collapse: \"V(s) >> MC_return, 两个分布几乎不重叠\"\n      008a_distribution: \"V(s) 略低于 MC_return，类似 baseline 但压缩\"\n      tcn_sigma02_distribution: \"V(s) 与 MC_return 保持 baseline-like 对齐，NVE < 1.0\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      V(s) vs MC_return 分布是 v/e ratio 的高维展开。\n      CIVO 不仅是均值偏移——trained dt_emb 导致 V(s) 分布的右尾异常膨胀\n      （部分 states 被极端高估），这些 states 驱动 actor 学习错误 policy。\n      Distribution plot 比单一 ratio 更 informative，直接回应 Reviewer R3 (v/e ratio 是 crude proxy)。\n      TCN σ=0.2 的分布应与 baseline 高度一致——这是 NVE < 1.0× 的分布层面验证。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 2×2 grid of V(s) vs MC_return scatter plots at 55K。(a) baseline: tight diagonal; (b) 008d: V(s) shifted right; (c) 008a: slightly below diagonal; (d) TCN σ=0.2: baseline-like。\"\n    analysis: >\n      如果时间允许，此图显著增强 C2 + C8 论证。直接回应 R3 concern。\n      不作为核心 claim 的依据，但作为补充证据提升 rigor。\n\n  - name: \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\"\n    plan_id: plan_033\n    description: >\n      追踪 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 向量之间的 cosine similarity 随训练步数的演变。\n    expected_results:\n      initial_cosine_sim: \"~0.0 (random initialization, near-orthogonal)\"\n      008d_cosine_sim_trajectory: \"0→0.3→0.6→0.85 by 35K (rapid differentiation)\"\n      008d_cosine_sim_at_collapse: \"~0.85-0.90 (highly aligned but distinct)\"\n      008a_cosine_sim_trajectory: \"stays ~0.0-0.1 throughout (no differentiation)\"\n      008f_cosine_sim: \"n/a (no dt_embedding)\"\n      015b_cosine_sim: \"fixed ~0.0 (frozen, no update)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Trained dt_emb 在训练中逐渐学会区分 dt=1 和 dt=2（cosine sim 变化反映 embedding 空间演化）。\n      预测 cosine sim 在崩溃前快速变化，因 reward head 和 obs decoder 的梯度\n      驱动 dt_emb 向最大区分方向优化。\n      008a (unexposed) 的 cosine sim 保持近零，因训练数据中只有 dt=1 transitions，\n      dt=2 slot 从未接收有意义梯度。\n      这从 embedding 空间视角补充 RSSM fidelity analysis 的机制故事。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Cosine similarity of dt_emb(1) vs dt_emb(2) over training. 008d (red): rapid rise to 0.85; 008a (blue): flat near 0; 015b (gray): fixed at 0.\"\n    analysis: >\n      P2 优先级。如果时间充裕，为 C2 机制叙事增加 embedding 空间的直觉。\n      不是 submission 必需，但可在 appendix 中提供。\n\n  - name: \"NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\"\n    plan_id: plan_034\n    description: >\n      在所有已有 seed 数据上计算 1.3×, 1.5×, 1.7×, 2.0× 阈值的分类准确率和 AUROC。\n    expected_results:\n      threshold_1_3x:\n        accuracy: 0.88\n        false_positives: \"~2 (transient NVE spikes in untrained configs)\"\n        false_negatives: 0\n      threshold_1_5x:\n        accuracy: 0.94\n        false_positives: 0\n        false_negatives: \"~1 (borderline trained seed with early self-correction)\"\n        classification: \"15/16 correct\"\n      threshold_1_7x:\n        accuracy: 0.91\n        false_positives: 0\n        false_negatives: \"~2 (seeds with moderate peak NVE)\"\n      threshold_2_0x:\n        accuracy: 0.84\n        false_positives: 0\n        false_negatives: \"~3-4 (seeds that peaked 1.5-2.0×)\"\n      auroc: 0.969\n      best_threshold: \"1.5× (optimal F1)\"\n      temporal_constraint: \"valid at 35K+ steps only (baseline v/e < 0.087 at 25K → unstable ratios)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      NVE 1.5× 阈值在 35K+ 时间窗口内实现最佳分类性能：\n      (1) 高于 1.3×：减少 false positives（untrained configs 的 transient spikes 通常 < 1.3×，\n          但 009c 在 105K 达 1.14× 和 008f_s4 peak 1.41× 在更低阈值下可能触发 FP）；\n      (2) 低于 1.7×：保留 self-correcting seeds 的检出力\n          （009b peak 1.62× 和 008d_s3 onset 1.5× 在 1.7× 处会被漏检）。\n      AUROC 0.969 反映 trained vs untrained dt_emb 的 NVE 分布几乎不重叠。\n      时间限定（35K+）是关键：25K 时 baseline v/e 仅 0.087，微小绝对差异被放大为大比率\n      （009b@25K NVE=2.05× 实为 false positive if applied at 25K）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"NVE 阈值分类性能\"\n        columns: [\"threshold\", \"accuracy\", \"FP\", \"FN\", \"F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1.3×\", 0.88, 2, 0, 0.90]\n          - [\"1.5×\", 0.94, 0, 1, 0.95]\n          - [\"1.7×\", 0.91, 0, 2, 0.91]\n          - [\"2.0×\", 0.84, 0, 4, 0.83]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: ROC curve for NVE-based CIVO classification. AUC=0.969. Annotate optimal threshold at 1.5×.\"\n    analysis: >\n      NVE ≥ 1.5× at 35K+ 是论文推荐的 CIVO 诊断标准。\n      AUROC=0.969 跨 2 environments（best tier 下加 Cartpole 升至 3 env），\n      是 C2 最强统计结果。论文 Table 2 呈现。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Cartpole Swingup — 第三环境验证（非 locomotion）\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_050\n    description: >\n      非 locomotion 环境的 dt=1 baseline。Cartpole Swingup 的 reward structure\n      （height-based, 0-1000 range）和 dynamics（1D cart + 1D pole）与 locomotion 不同，\n      用于测试 CIVO 机制是否跨任务类型泛化。\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_105K: 780\n      seed0_eval_peak: 845\n      seed0_ve_ratio_stable: 0.65\n      seed1_eval_105K: 820\n      seed1_eval_peak: 870\n      seed1_ve_ratio_stable: 0.68\n      seed2_eval_105K: 755\n      seed2_eval_peak: 830\n      seed2_ve_ratio_stable: 0.63\n      cross_seed_eval_mean_105K: 785\n      cross_seed_eval_std: 33\n      convergence_step: \"~90K\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      DreamerV3 在 Cartpole Swingup 上表现良好，典型 eval ~800-870。\n      收敛快于 locomotion 任务（~90K vs ~120K），因状态空间低维（cart position + velocity + pole angle + angular velocity = 4D），\n      RSSM 学习高效。v/e ratio 稳定在 0.63-0.68，略低于 Walker（0.69-0.72），\n      因 Cartpole 的 sparse initial reward（swingup phase）导致 value 校准略慢。\n      跨 seed 方差小（SD~33），因任务确定性高（不像 locomotion 有 contact dynamics 噪声）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Cartpole baseline 建立非 locomotion 参考。eval ~785±33, v/e ~0.65。\n      为 plan_051/052 的 NVE 归一化提供基准。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_051\n    description: >\n      核心跨任务泛化测试：Cartpole 上 trained dt_emb 是否同样触发 CIVO？\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_peak: 520\n      seed0_eval_105K: 95\n      seed0_nve_peak: 3.2\n      seed0_collapse: true\n      seed0_collapse_onset: 55000\n      seed1_eval_peak: 610\n      seed1_eval_105K: 580\n      seed1_nve_peak: 1.85\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed1_self_correction: true\n      seed2_eval_peak: 480\n      seed2_eval_105K: 70\n      seed2_nve_peak: 4.5\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      seed2_collapse_onset: 45000\n      cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x: \"3/3\"\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"2/3\"\n      civo_severity: \"moderate (NVE 1.85-4.5×, between Walker 2-4× and Cheetah 8-70×)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      CIVO 机制是 architecture-level（RSSM fidelity gap + dt_embedding co-adaptation），\n      不依赖特定任务的 reward structure 或 dynamics 类型。\n      Cartpole 的 CIVO severity 预计介于 Walker 和 Cheetah 之间：\n      - 状态空间简单（4D）→ RSSM fidelity gap 适中 → NVE 不会达到 Cheetah 的极端水平；\n      - 但 reward landscape（swingup → balance 的 phase transition）使 dt>1 prediction error\n        在 critical states 被放大 → severity 略高于 Walker。\n      3/3 seeds 超 NVE 1.5× 阈值（100%），2/3 崩溃（~67%），\n      与 Walker (~50%) 和 Cheetah (100%) 一致的方向。\n      collapse rate 在非 locomotion 环境成立 → 机制泛化确认。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cartpole CIVO 全 seed\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_peak\", \"eval_105K\", \"nve_peak\", \"collapse\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0\", 520, 95, 3.2, \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"s1\", 610, 580, 1.85, \"No (self-corrected)\"]\n          - [\"s2\", 480, 70, 4.5, \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Cartpole CIVO learning curves — 3 seeds 叠加 baseline 虚线。与 Walker/Cheetah 同格式便于跨环境对比。\"\n    analysis: >\n      C1+C2 跨任务泛化确认。非 locomotion 环境仍 3/3 seeds NVE > 1.5×。\n      这将论文的 scope 从 \"locomotion-specific\" 扩展到 \"DreamerV3 architecture-level\"。\n      NVE 1.5× threshold 跨 3 environments 成立，强化 plan_034 的 AUROC。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: plan_052\n    description: >\n      Cartpole 因果控制：去掉 dt_embedding 应消除 CIVO。\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_105K: 290\n      seed0_nve_max: 0.75\n      seed0_civo: false\n      seed1_eval_105K: 340\n      seed1_nve_max: 0.60\n      seed1_civo: false\n      seed2_eval_105K: 310\n      seed2_nve_max: 0.85\n      seed2_civo: false\n      cross_seed_nve_max: 0.85\n      cross_seed_civo_rate: \"0/3\"\n      vs_baseline_pct: \"~40% of baseline\"\n      reward_degradation: \"moderate (reward_MAE ~50-70× baseline)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      与 Walker 008f 和 Cheetah 024b 模式一致：\n      去掉 dt_embedding → CIVO 阻断（0/3 NVE > 1.5×），但 reward prediction 严重退化。\n      Cartpole 的 performance penalty（~40% baseline）介于 Walker（~45%）和 Cheetah（~14%）之间，\n      因 Cartpole reward structure 的中等复杂度。\n      NVE 保持 < 1.0×，critic 偏向低估而非高估。\n      跨 3 环境，no-dt-emb 的 CIVO 消除率为 100%（Walker 4/4, Cheetah 2/2, Cartpole 3/3 = 9/9）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"No-dt-emb 因果控制跨 3 环境汇总\"\n        columns: [\"environment\", \"seeds_tested\", \"nve_above_1.5x\", \"civo_rate\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker Walk\", \"4+\", \"0\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah Run\", \"2+\", \"0\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"Cartpole Swingup\", 3, 0, \"0%\"]\n          - [\"Total\", \"9+\", \"0\", \"0%\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      跨 3 环境的嵌入移除 → CIVO 消除（9/9 = 100%），\n      vs trained dt_emb → CIVO 触发（~8/9 seeds NVE > 1.5×）。\n      这是论文中最干净的因果证据。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Forward-pass intervention 方法验证（C8 核心）\n  # ============================================================\n  # 注：TCN/RAVE 实验不在 experiment_plan 中但在 registry 中。\n  # 以下 plan_060 是 forward-pass intervention 的替代方案。\n\n  - name: \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\"\n    plan_id: plan_060\n    description: >\n      监控 imagination rollout 中 RSSM prediction uncertainty，超阈值时截断。\n      与 TCN（已验证）互补的 forward-pass 干预思路。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_peak: 450\n      eval_105K: 380\n      nve_max: 1.8\n      nve_mean_65K_105K: 1.2\n      collapse: false\n      truncation_rate_at_105K: \"~30% of imagination steps truncated at dt=2\"\n      effective_horizon_reduction: \"H_eff ~12.5 (from H=15, due to truncation)\"\n      civo_reduction_vs_untreated: \"partial (NVE 1.8× vs untreated 2-4×)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Uncertainty-gated truncation 在 RSSM 预测不确定性高时缩短 imagination horizon。\n      这是 forward-pass 层面的干预——不修改 embedding 或梯度，而是限制不可靠 prediction 的使用范围。\n      预测部分有效（NVE 1.8× vs untreated 2-4×），因为：\n      (1) RSSM uncertainty 确实在 dt>1 步较高，truncation 减少了不可靠 predictions 对 value 的影响；\n      (2) 但 uncertainty calibration 不完美——RSSM 的 aleatoric/epistemic uncertainty 估计\n          可能滞后于实际 prediction error 的恶化，导致截断时机偏晚；\n      (3) truncation 减少有效 horizon，牺牲 long-horizon credit assignment。\n      相比 TCN σ=0.2 的完全 CIVO 预防（NVE < 1.0×），truncation 是 weaker intervention，\n      但提供 mechanistic insight：RSSM uncertainty 与 CIVO 风险正相关。\n      在 best tier 叙事中，truncation 作为 \"forward-pass intervention 有效性的独立确认\"，\n      而 TCN 是推荐的 principled mitigation。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig (appendix): Truncation rate vs training step。随训练推进，dt=2 imagination 被截断比例逐渐下降（RSSM improves），但 CIVO 已在早期种下。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Plan_060 在 best tier 中是辅助证据，非核心。\n      TCN 已占据 C8 的 primary mitigation 位置。\n      Truncation 的部分成功（NVE 从 2-4× 降至 ~1.8×）进一步确认 forward-pass 是正确的干预层级，\n      但 TCN 的 mechanism（降低 conditioning precision）比 truncation（缩短 horizon）更根本。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Hopper Hop — 第四环境（P2, stretch goal）\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\"\n    plan_id: plan_040\n    description: >\n      P2 stretch goal。Hopper Hop 是高难 locomotion 任务（需要单腿跳跃），\n      DreamerV3 baseline 性能有限。如完成，提供第四环境的 C1+C2 验证。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline:\n        seed0_eval_105K: 210\n        seed1_eval_105K: 250\n        seed2_eval_105K: 180\n        cross_seed_mean: 213\n        ve_ratio_stable: 0.55\n      trained_dt_emb:\n        seed0_eval_105K: 45\n        seed0_nve_peak: 5.2\n        seed0_collapse: true\n        seed1_eval_105K: 120\n        seed1_nve_peak: 2.8\n        seed1_collapse: false\n        seed2_eval_105K: 30\n        seed2_nve_peak: 7.1\n        seed2_collapse: true\n        cross_seed_nve_above_1_5x: \"3/3\"\n        cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"2/3\"\n      no_dt_emb:\n        seed0_eval_105K: 55\n        seed0_nve_max: 0.6\n        seed1_eval_105K: 70\n        seed1_nve_max: 0.45\n        seed2_eval_105K: 50\n        seed2_nve_max: 0.7\n        cross_seed_civo_rate: \"0/3\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Hopper Hop 是高难任务，DreamerV3 baseline 仅 ~200-250（满分 ~1000）。\n      CIVO 在 Hopper 上预计严重：\n      (1) 跳跃动力学高度非线性（contact/flight phase transitions），RSSM 在 dt>1 的 prediction error 大；\n      (2) 奖励稀疏（只有成功跳跃时获得高奖励），value overestimation 对 policy 影响更大；\n      (3) 低 baseline 性能意味着 CIVO 的相对破坏更 catastrophic。\n      NVE 预计 2.8-7.1×（介于 Walker 和 Cheetah 之间），3/3 超 1.5× 阈值。\n      No-dt-emb 控制：0/3 CIVO，eval ~55（baseline 的 ~26%），严重 reward degradation。\n      如完成，将 cross-env validation 扩展到 4 environments（Walker, Cheetah, Cartpole, Hopper）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"跨 4 环境 NVE 1.5× threshold 汇总 (best tier)\"\n        columns: [\"environment\", \"trained_above_1.5x\", \"untrained_below_1.5x\", \"total_correct\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker Walk\", \"5/5\", \"4/4\", \"9/9\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah Run\", \"3/3\", \"2/2\", \"5/5\"]\n          - [\"Cartpole Swingup\", \"3/3\", \"3/3\", \"6/6\"]\n          - [\"Hopper Hop\", \"3/3\", \"3/3\", \"6/6\"]\n          - [\"Total\", \"14/14\", \"12/12\", \"26/26\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      如完成，26/26 = 100% classification accuracy 跨 4 环境，\n      AUROC→1.0。但 plan_040 是 P2，best tier 不需要此数据——\n      3 环境（Walker + Cheetah + Cartpole）已足够支撑 cross-env generalization claim。\n      Hopper 数据若存在可放入 appendix 作为额外 robustness evidence。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Best tier 叙事整合与 claim 支撑总结\n  # ============================================================\n\n  # 以下为 best tier 下所有 8 claims 的数据支撑度评估\n\nclaim_support_summary:\n  C1_variable_rate_degradation:\n    status: \"STRONG\"\n    environments: 3\n    total_configs: \"7+\"\n    evidence: \"dt=2 和 dt=4 在 Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole 上全部退化。无正面案例。\"\n  C2_trained_dt_emb_civo_trigger:\n    status: \"STRONG\"\n    nve_threshold_auroc: 0.969\n    cross_env_seeds: \"14/14 trained > 1.5× across 3 envs\"\n    causal_control: \"9/9 no-dt-emb seeds < 1.5×\"\n    evidence: \"NVE≥1.5× 诊断标记跨环境 100% 分离。\"\n  C3_untrained_emb_protection:\n    status: \"STRONG\"\n    walker_seeds: \"3/3 NVE < 1.0×\"\n    cheetah_seeds: \"3/3 NVE < 0.5×\"\n    mechanism: \"value growth suppression structural, not transient\"\n  C4_dt_amplification:\n    status: \"MODERATE\"\n    evidence: \"dt=1 > dt=2 > dt=4 monotonic in Walker. Only 2 dt values tested.\"\n  C5_horizon_secondary:\n    status: \"MODERATE\"\n    evidence: \"subsample ≠ root cause (008c stable, 008e_v3 stable with subsample ON)\"\n  C6_dt1_imag_partial:\n    status: \"STRONG (partially falsified → dual pathway finding)\"\n    collapse_rate: \"2/4 seeds (50%, same as dt=2)\"\n    pathway_A: \"CIVO (value-driven, entropy ↓) — eliminated by dt=1 restriction\"\n    pathway_B: \"policy instability (eval-driven, entropy ↑) — NOT eliminated\"\n  C7_sgs_failure:\n    status: \"STRONG\"\n    total_seeds: 17\n    sgs_variants: 3\n    environments: 2\n    success_rate: \"1/17 (with value collapse side effect)\"\n    embedding_removal_rate: \"5/5 prevention\"\n    core_finding: \"gradient magnitude ≠ causal importance; backward-pass categorically insufficient\"\n  C8_forward_pass_intervention:\n    status: \"STRONG (best tier: cross-seed + cross-env validated)\"\n    tcn_walker_sigma02: \"2/2 seeds NVE < 1.0× throughout\"\n    tcn_cheetah_sigma05: \"NVE 1.5-4.0× (2-5× reduction from untreated 8-108×)\"\n    dose_response: \"σ scales with environment CIVO severity\"\n    cross_env_prevention: \"≥ 3/4 seeds\"\n    rave_failure: \"EMA anchor pollution → negative\"\n    paper_upgrade: \"diagnosis → diagnosis + principled mitigation\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"7bacc094-afad-45f1-94e3-eeb8a582e328","total_cost_usd":1.4894195,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":75904,"cache_read_input_tokens":323515,"output_tokens":32237,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":75904,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":18475,"cache_read_input_tokens":86599,"cache_creation_input_tokens":752,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":752},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":47147,"outputTokens":32,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.047307,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":6,"outputTokens":32237,"cacheReadInputTokens":323515,"cacheCreationInputTokens":75904,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.4421125,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"ee0e3253-292d-4589-b204-5468ad134c2b"}
